    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish provider status chip: AI Polish is off.\nLive Preview settings: status off label.\nMicrophone settings: readiness option; the microphone is released at once.\nShort disabled-state label shared by AI polish, model unload policy, microphone readiness, Live Preview, and switches.\nVoiceOver: the value of a switch that is off.",
