    "The privacy-first dictation app built for macOS." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Diktier-App für macOS, bei der Datenschutz an erster Stelle steht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech engine did not finish waking up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Spracherkennung wurde nicht vollständig gestartet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech engine that turns your voice into text." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: the one-line description under a page title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Spracherkennung, die Gesprochenes in Text umwandelt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The spelling \"%@\" may not be added, because %@ already uses it." : {
      "comment" : "Your Words, import review: a row's note. The first %@ is a misheard form, the second the word that has it; use this language's quotation marks.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The spelling \"%1$@\" may not be added, because %2$@ already uses it."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Schreibweise „%1$@“ kann nicht hinzugefügt werden, weil %2$@ sie bereits verwendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test judge from the UAT door failed to load" : {
      "comment" : "Your Words, Learn from: the self-learning dictionary row: the line under the switch. Developer builds only.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Testbewertung aus dem UAT-Bereich konnte nicht geladen werden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text for %@ contains characters EnviousWispr can't store. Nothing was imported." : {
      "comment" : "Snippets, import: error. %@ is the snippet's trigger, already quoted.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Text für %@ enthält Zeichen, die EnviousWispr nicht speichern kann. Es wurde nichts importiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text for %@ is longer than %@ characters. Nothing was imported." : {
      "comment" : "Snippets, import: error. the first %@ is the snippet's trigger, already quoted; the second a large limit (never 1).",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The text for %1$@ is longer than %2$@ characters. Nothing was imported."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Text für %1$@ ist länger als %2$@ Zeichen. Es wurde nichts importiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcription engine didn't start. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File: why the file was refused.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Transkriptions-Engine konnte nicht gestartet werden. Versuche es erneut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The word to add" : {
      "comment" : "Quick Add panel: the placeholder in the field for typing a word.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wort zum Hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no snippets to export yet." : {
      "comment" : "Snippets, export: notice when the list is empty.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es gibt noch keine Textbausteine zum Exportieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no words of your own to export yet. Vocabulary packs are not included." : {
      "comment" : "Your Words, export: only vocabulary packs exist.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es gibt noch keine eigenen Wörter zum Exportieren. Wortschatzpakete werden nicht mit exportiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no sound in that file." : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File: why the file was refused.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Datei enthält keinen Ton."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are general open models, not tuned for dictation the way EG-1 is. Quality depends on the model you download, and larger models run slower. You pick and manage the models yourself in the list below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das sind allgemeine offene Modelle. Anders als EG-1 wurden sie nicht für Diktate abgestimmt. Die Qualität hängt vom heruntergeladenen Modell ab; größere Modelle arbeiten langsamer. Wähle und verwalte die Modelle unten selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These let EnviousWispr listen and paste for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Damit kann EnviousWispr zuhören und Text für dich einfügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These words are not saved to History. Copy or save them before you leave, or press Clean it again to retry." : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File: nothing was saved to History. 'Clean it again' is a button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Wörter sind nicht im Verlauf gespeichert. Kopiere oder speichere sie, bevor du die Ansicht verlässt, oder wähle „Erneut nachbearbeiten“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These words are only on this screen. Copy or save them before you leave." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Wörter sind nur hier sichtbar. Kopiere oder speichere sie, bevor du die Ansicht verlässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These words become marks even when you meant the word itself, like \"the grace period expires\". Slash works with this setting off: \"slash clear\" becomes /clear, \"command is slash wfp\" becomes command is /wfp, \"pros slash cons\" becomes pros/cons, and \"slash the budget\" stays words. Some verb uses, like \"slash prices\", can still become a symbol." : {
      "comment" : "Speech engine settings, spoken punctuation: help panel footnote. The quoted phrases are English words the user says to dictation; keep them in English, and keep /clear, /wfp and pros/cons exactly.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Wörter werden zu Satzzeichen, selbst wenn du das Wort selbst meintest, etwa in „the grace period expires“. „Slash“ funktioniert auch bei ausgeschalteter Einstellung: „slash clear“ wird zu /clear, „command is slash wfp“ zu command is /wfp und „pros slash cons“ zu pros/cons. „slash the budget“ bleibt Text. Bei manchen Verwendungen als Verb, etwa „slash prices“, kann trotzdem ein Zeichen entstehen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They are still saved on your Mac. Nothing has been changed or deleted, and EnviousWispr will not write over them. Restart the app, and tell us if this keeps happening." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie sind weiterhin auf deinem Mac gespeichert. Nichts wurde geändert oder gelöscht, und EnviousWispr wird sie nicht überschreiben. Starte die App neu und sag uns Bescheid, falls das wieder passiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac" : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File, Review step: the cleanup runs on this Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac does not support Apple Intelligence. Requires Apple Silicon (M1 or later)." : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish, Apple Intelligence: whether the on-device model can be used on this Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Mac unterstützt Apple Intelligence nicht. Erfordert Apple Silicon (M1 oder neuer)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac has 8 GB of memory. %@ may run slower here. Dictation always works, even when polish is unavailable." : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish, local model card: low-memory note. %@ is the model name, such as EG-1.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Mac hat 8 GB Arbeitsspeicher. %@ kann hier langsamer laufen. Diktieren funktioniert immer, auch wenn die Nachbearbeitung nicht verfügbar ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac · Apple GPU" : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File: where the All Languages engine runs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Mac · Apple GPU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac · Neural Engine" : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File: where the Fast engine runs. Neural Engine is Apple's chip name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Mac · Neural Engine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build has no download source configured." : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish, local model card: why the model download failed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für diesen Build ist keine Downloadquelle eingerichtet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build was compiled without Apple Intelligence support." : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish, Apple Intelligence: whether the on-device model can be used on this Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Version wurde ohne Unterstützung für Apple Intelligence erstellt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This changes dictation too, not just the preview. On Automatic, dictation follows what you speak, but the preview must pick one language up front and uses your Mac's." : {
      "comment" : "Live Preview settings: picker apple caveat.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das ändert auch das Diktieren, nicht nur die Vorschau. Bei „Automatisch“ folgt das Diktat deiner gesprochenen Sprache. Die Vorschau muss vorab eine Sprache wählen und verwendet die Sprache deines Macs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This changes dictation too, not just the preview. On Automatic, this engine works the language out as you speak." : {
      "comment" : "Live Preview settings: picker universal caveat.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das ändert auch das Diktieren, nicht nur die Vorschau. Bei „Automatisch“ erkennt diese Engine die Sprache während des Sprechens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This choice also changes the transcription engine used for dictation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Auswahl ändert auch die Spracherkennung für Diktate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This engine has to commit to a language before it can start. If your language is set to Auto-detect, EnviousWispr ignores this setting and transcribes after you stop instead, because guessing the language early gets it wrong too often." : {
      "comment" : "Speech engine settings, Faster Transcription: help panel: explanation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Engine muss vor dem Start eine Sprache festlegen. Wenn „Sprache automatisch erkennen“ eingeschaltet ist, ignoriert EnviousWispr diese Einstellung und transkribiert erst nach dem Stoppen. Eine frühe Schätzung der Sprache liegt zu oft daneben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This engine transcribes differently from the Fast engine, so its behaviour and the advice here are not the same." : {
      "comment" : "Speech engine settings, Faster Transcription: help panel footnote.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Engine transkribiert anders als die schnelle Engine. Deshalb gelten hier andere Hinweise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file" : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File, Working page: heading of the file summary, shown in capitals.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DIESE DATEI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This import could not be applied. Nothing was changed." : {
      "comment" : "Import: applying the import failed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Import konnte nicht angewendet werden. Es wurde nichts geändert."
          }
