      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warum Gemini verwenden?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why use Ollama" : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish: card title explaining a provider.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warum Ollama verwenden?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why use OpenAI" : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish: card title explaining a provider.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Warum OpenAI verwenden?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With this on, EnviousWispr transcribes overlapping chunks of audio while you talk and joins them together. When two chunks disagree about the same moment of speech, nothing can tell which reading was right. The longer you talk, the more joins there are, so the problem grows with length." : {
      "comment" : "Speech engine settings, Faster Transcription: help panel: explanation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn dies eingeschaltet ist, transkribiert EnviousWispr während des Sprechens überlappende Audioabschnitte und fügt sie zusammen. Wenn zwei Abschnitte dieselbe Stelle unterschiedlich erkennen, lässt sich nicht sicher sagen, welche Fassung stimmt. Je länger du sprichst, desto mehr Übergänge gibt es und desto größer wird das Problem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word errors" : {
      "comment" : "Speech engine settings, Faster Transcription: help panel table: a measured quantity.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wortfehler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words so far" : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File, Working page: a live count's label.",
      "localizations" : {
