            "value" : "Dein Transkript wird erstellt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working out what your new language needs. This updates when the download finishes." : {
      "comment" : "Live Preview settings: status language changed detail.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Anforderungen für deine neue Sprache werden ermittelt. Die Anzeige aktualisiert sich nach dem Download."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working, but responding slowly right now." : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish, local model card: the reason under the health status.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Funktioniert, antwortet derzeit aber langsam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works on macOS 14 and later, in more languages. Needs one optional 217 MB download." : {
      "comment" : "Live Preview settings, preview engine: universal description. 217 MB is a download size.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Funktioniert ab macOS 14 und unterstützt mehr Sprachen. Ein optionaler Download von 217 MB ist nötig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works only when you are not recording: the cancel keybind (%@) uses these keys while you record." : {
      "comment" : "Keybinds settings: a conflict warning. %@ is a key combination, such as Right ⌘.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
